WEBVTT

00:00:22.440 --> 00:00:24.230
The princess's army...?

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:32.850
She is advancing on the capital,
together with rebels from all over the kingdom.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.690
It sounds to me like you were
unable to dispose of the princess.

00:00:37.690 --> 00:00:43.100
I miscalculated their strength, that is all.

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:45.230
The next time, I will make sure...

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:52.350
I need a little time to pray right now.

00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:55.850
Do not underestimate the princess's army's power.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:00:59.730
Pope Vall D'Hebron...

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:07.580
"Royal Knight"
"Flegel Dreadnought"

00:01:01.940 --> 00:01:07.230
Squad 2 of the Royal Order is ready to go into battle.

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:12.480
You may rest assured that we will put
down the rebel army led by the princess.

00:01:12.480 --> 00:01:15.900
I look forward to that, Flegel.

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:17.770
And when we do,

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:23.270
I ask that you consider that matter
I mentioned earlier, if you please.

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:30.310
We still do not know where Balthauser is.
You are being quite hasty.

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:36.400
There is no one other than me
who can take my grandfather's place.

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:40.600
The lord of Albert appears
to be among the rebel army.

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:45.150
Is that right?

00:01:45.150 --> 00:01:49.810
I shall give you my Paladin Corps.

00:01:49.810 --> 00:01:54.230
I am most appreciative. Now, I must be off.

00:01:56.020 --> 00:02:00.150
At last, the time has come to settle the score...

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:02.350
...son of Fernando...!

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:43.230
There they are! So many soldiers!

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:48.400
I even recognize some of their faces.
The ones who are always interrupting us.

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.440
--Are you all right?
--I can't stop the bleeding!

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:51.810
Then today's the day when we have to punish them.

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:55.900
Those two again?!

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.980
<i>They've</i> spotted us, as well.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:00.230
Is this a Hortensian Army ambush?!

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:02.230
No, that's the princess's army!

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:04.150
Those Camellians!

00:04:04.150 --> 00:04:05.010
Counterattack!

00:04:05.010 --> 00:04:06.150
Draw your swords!

00:04:06.150 --> 00:04:08.600
Not so fast! Re-form ranks!

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:10.810
Mister...

00:04:12.350 --> 00:04:14.440
You die today!

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:15.980
Stop this, both of you!

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.230
Elva, stay back!

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:24.350
What was that for?

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:27.100
Are you trying to get in our way, too?

00:04:31.150 --> 00:04:34.480
You are overstepping your bounds.

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:36.730
Roy Bachelot!

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:39.730
You, who were once just a little boy,

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:43.940
are now a leader of the forces led by the princess?

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:45.730
You've changed so much.

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:52.190
Stop interfering! We're so bored!

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:54.770
We don't mind killing you first.

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:59.150
Don't push it. I'm not going to let you ruin our plans.

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.020
Plans?

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:01.480
We don't care about that!

00:05:01.480 --> 00:05:02.810
Yeah!

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:05.350
If you cannot contain yourselves,

00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:08.020
Theresia will end up paying the price, as well.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:11.480
What's the big idea?

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:15.190
Saying something like that isn't fair.

00:05:15.190 --> 00:05:17.520
I'm sorry you had to see that.

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:21.900
This was an inadvertent accident.
It was not what Camellia intended.

00:05:21.900 --> 00:05:25.100
We will take our leave of you now.

00:05:25.100 --> 00:05:26.600
What are you doing?!

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:32.810
Camellia will not take any hostile
action toward the princess's forces.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:36.310
I swear it on our scarlet camellias
and on my own pride.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:48.900
All right. I'll take your pride at your word.

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:53.730
Hey, come on, are you sure?

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:56.190
I'm glad to hear you don't oppose us, but...

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:57.480
Enemy attack!

00:06:00.060 --> 00:06:01.270
Ecclesiastical Knights?!

00:06:01.270 --> 00:06:02.980
They're here, all right!

00:06:02.980 --> 00:06:04.150
Let's go!

00:06:04.150 --> 00:06:06.690
Hey! Are we just going to let them go?!

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:11.810
There aren't that many of them!
We'll crush them at once!

00:06:11.810 --> 00:06:13.730
Charge!

00:06:17.900 --> 00:06:18.940
Those are...!

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:28.350
Hey, what are those?!

00:06:28.350 --> 00:06:32.520
I don't know. They don't seem
to be any kind of magic, though.

00:06:32.520 --> 00:06:33.810
Release!

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:43.060
Huh? Are they finished already?

00:06:45.560 --> 00:06:48.150
After they use them once,
they can't use them again for a short while.

00:06:49.440 --> 00:06:50.520
Let's go!

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:51.980
Hurry it up!

00:06:57.190 --> 00:06:58.690
Who are these guys?

00:06:58.690 --> 00:07:00.980
There were only this few of them?

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:05.060
For such new gear, it's awfully hard to use.

00:07:05.060 --> 00:07:07.850
So the Orthodox Church has these.

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:19.190
Don't ever step out of line again.

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:22.980
I'll let you off this time,
but know that there won't be a next time.

00:07:28.020 --> 00:07:32.690
Aren't you being too easy on them?
Shouldn't we punish them severely?

00:07:32.690 --> 00:07:35.980
They are partners from our allied nation.

00:07:35.980 --> 00:07:40.310
Camellia only exists right now
because Daire is backing us up.

00:07:40.310 --> 00:07:43.060
I am aware of that, but still...

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:48.020
So, who was it that accepted your truce?

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:50.690
Alfred, Lord of Albert.

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:58.230
He chose to honor a truce for his men
rather than settle matters as a knight.

00:07:58.230 --> 00:08:00.190
That's very good of him.

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:05.020
The Camellian army continues to stay back.

00:08:05.020 --> 00:08:09.810
Is this really a good idea?
They may start attacking from anywhere.

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:14.310
Roy Bachelot... meant no deceit in what he said.

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:17.940
Camellian knights place especially
high value on their pride.

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:22.520
His own pride won't allow him
to break his promise.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:26.810
He also said he would take no hostile
action toward the princess's army.

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:30.650
That means that they <i>are</i> intent
on fighting the Orthodox Church.

00:08:30.650 --> 00:08:32.940
The enemy of my enemy is my friend?

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:35.350
Yeah. I can't be certain, though.

00:08:35.350 --> 00:08:39.230
No, your judgment is right.

00:08:39.230 --> 00:08:44.100
If Camellia is going to stay out of our way,
then we should leave them be.

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:48.690
Yes. First, we must liberate
the people of this country.

00:08:48.690 --> 00:08:51.060
That just leaves these.

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:52.400
Muskets...

00:08:52.400 --> 00:08:54.060
You know what they are?

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:57.520
Yeah. They were mentioned
in our secret agents' reports.

00:08:57.520 --> 00:09:01.020
They're weapons that shoot out
metal balls using explosive force.

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:04.520
I didn't expect to see these in combat so soon.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:10.270
These have enough force to penetrate
iron armor, even from a distance.

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:12.600
What's more, they don't require much training.

00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:15.230
Qoo will protect you, Nonnoria!

00:09:13.480 --> 00:09:15.230
Seriously?

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:17.520
But not to worry.

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:17.520
Oh, Qoo!

00:09:17.520 --> 00:09:23.690
It's not that easy to hit what you're aiming for,
and it takes time to make each shot.

00:09:23.690 --> 00:09:27.060
Still, depending on the enemy formation,
those could pose a serious threat.

00:09:27.060 --> 00:09:31.230
The main Ecclesiastical Order
is probably equipped with those, too.

00:09:32.690 --> 00:09:35.440
Our reconnaissance unit has come
into contact with the enemy force.

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:38.650
After engaging them in combat,
they were wiped out.

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:41.600
It was just a trial run for the muskets,

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:45.730
so the loss of the unit was within expectations.

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:46.850
Anything else?

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:53.560
Y-Yes. The force of the muskets proved
to be extremely effective. Also,

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:57.690
Alfred Albert was seen at
the forefront of the enemy force.

00:09:57.690 --> 00:10:04.150
Indeed. Then that infernal man
must be in command of the rebel army.

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:07.350
The son of the Templar knight Fernando,

00:10:07.350 --> 00:10:13.310
and myself, grandson of the Royal Knight
Balthauser, hailed as the immortal hero.

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:15.770
For the table to be set as neatly as this,

00:10:15.770 --> 00:10:19.770
it really feels like some kind
of fate is at work here.

00:10:19.770 --> 00:10:24.350
Flegel, the Paladin musket detail has arrived.

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:27.730
Hmm, very good.

00:10:27.730 --> 00:10:30.560
The time is ripe.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:34.230
The time to drop the iron hammer
of justice on these rebels is here!

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:36.270
And as for that man...

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:39.980
...his defeat will pave the way for my triumph!

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:56.170
December 1, 771, New Holy Era
Visto Bridge, Racines River

00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:55.600
Sure enough, this is where they have taken position.

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:58.850
That unit is...!

00:10:58.850 --> 00:11:02.270
Balthauser's Squad 2, isn't it?

00:11:02.270 --> 00:11:03.850
Squad 2?

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:06.350
One of the best, most elite squads of the Royal Order.

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:10.190
What is the old man doing,
throwing in with the Orthodox Church?

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:11.560
I bring a report!

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:14.270
I have identified the commander of the enemy force.

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:15.980
It is Flegel Dreadnought.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:17.980
Huh?! It can't be!

00:11:17.980 --> 00:11:20.810
Balthauser's grandson, Flegel?!

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:25.400
That mediocre young boy?!
What has become of the old man?!

00:11:25.400 --> 00:11:28.190
You don't think something has
happened to Balthauser, do you?

00:11:28.190 --> 00:11:30.600
I won't hear of it!

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:37.190
Muskets, the Paladin unit, and now Squad 2?

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:38.440
What do we do?

00:11:40.520 --> 00:11:44.520
As expected, the enemy force
has deployed in front of the bridge.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:50.440
Very well. All of their substandard troops
could not withstand a drawn-out fight.

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:53.100
They have no choice but to cross the bridge.

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:57.560
And with our powerful weapons
and the elite forces of both orders,

00:11:57.560 --> 00:12:00.650
our victory is assured.

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:02.730
No matter how many casualties there are,

00:12:02.730 --> 00:12:06.190
once I distinguish myself with this victory,

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:09.150
my honor will be genuine.

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:15.400
The enemy before us is Squad 2 of the
Royal Order, and the main Paladin force.

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:18.230
There are Paladins equipped with muskets deployed

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:20.810
on either side of Visto Bridge.

00:12:20.810 --> 00:12:23.600
We will first deploy our archer units
on both sides of the bridge.

00:12:23.600 --> 00:12:26.310
Maurice and Bertrand Squads
will reinforce their defenses

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:27.560
and advance across the bridge.

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:31.190
Won't Pops and his men
be in the muskets' crossfire?

00:12:31.190 --> 00:12:34.230
I hate to ask, but I'll need
you to tough it out for a bit.

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:36.480
We're not going to last that long.

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:39.230
I know. While they're at it, a separate squad

00:12:39.230 --> 00:12:41.520
will attack the musket units
on the bridge's sides.

00:12:41.520 --> 00:12:43.810
A sneak attack, huh?

00:12:43.810 --> 00:12:47.520
If the whole force charges forward,
those muskets will chew us up.

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:50.810
All we can do is attack them by surprise,
confuse them, and then charge in.

00:12:50.810 --> 00:12:53.150
Do you really think that will work?

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:56.560
If those of us in the detached force
can collapse their formation...

00:12:56.560 --> 00:12:59.690
"Us"? You mean I'm going in, too?!

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:03.100
I'll be counting on you.

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:04.560
Are you serious?

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:11.100
What's wrong? I thought you were
ready to offer yourself up to me.

00:13:13.690 --> 00:13:14.810
All right!

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:19.190
Count me in! Let's get moving, Alfred!
Time to get fired up!

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:20.190
Yeah.

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:28.020
Okay, start pushing!

00:13:30.020 --> 00:13:31.940
What are those?

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:33.150
Wagons?!

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:35.440
Fire!

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:37.230
What do we do if they hit us?

00:13:38.650 --> 00:13:41.480
Consider yourself unlucky, what else?!

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:44.810
They've started.

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:46.440
Circle around, now!

00:13:54.690 --> 00:13:56.440
So, it's started.

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:58.310
Yeah.

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:02.230
But this is not going to turn out well.

00:14:02.230 --> 00:14:04.020
What shall we do?

00:14:09.190 --> 00:14:13.480
We're going to sweep away the approaching
enemy from our favorable position!

00:14:13.480 --> 00:14:16.690
Even better, Fernando's son
is the one in command.

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:22.650
You can die writhing in agony,
as you provide me with the means

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:26.690
to become a commander in the Royal Order!

00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:29.650
Flegel!

00:14:29.650 --> 00:14:31.310
What is it?

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:33.100
It's the musket detail on the left flank!

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:40.060
They suddenly showed up from upstream.

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:43.400
Give me that!

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:49.060
Alfred Albert...

00:14:50.770 --> 00:14:51.810
Die!

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:55.480
What is this?!

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:05.350
Second volley, release!

00:15:10.730 --> 00:15:14.690
C-Camellia, is it?!

00:15:16.440 --> 00:15:19.650
It looks like Alfred's read of the situation was right.

00:15:19.650 --> 00:15:22.520
I never would have counted
on them actually coming.

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:25.770
We have to make the most
of this opportunity! Let's go!

00:15:25.770 --> 00:15:29.060
Men, charge!

00:15:30.560 --> 00:15:32.650
Bowmen, cover them!

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:35.060
Here I go!

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:46.690
Flegel! The princess's army

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:49.650
is using the Camellian forces
as cover for their attack!

00:15:49.650 --> 00:15:52.190
Send Squad 2 to the fore!

00:15:52.190 --> 00:15:56.100
Flegel, the musket detail can't hold out any longer!

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:58.850
Send the Ecclesiastical Knights to the left flank--

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:02.060
Follow the advance force in! All units, charge!

00:16:05.100 --> 00:16:08.270
Hey, what is Squad 2 waiting for?!

00:16:08.270 --> 00:16:11.560
You call yourselves an elite unit?!
Stop them like your lives depend on it!

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:12.850
Flegel!

00:16:12.850 --> 00:16:15.400
Our losses are enormous! With all due respect,

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:17.690
we should fall back to the capital!

00:16:17.690 --> 00:16:20.230
Shut up! I don't want your opinion!

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:26.650
Do you have any idea how much
I've sacrificed to lead my own force?

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:29.770
Even removing my own grandfather!

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:37.850
This is all because of him--
Fernando's son...

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:44.190
If only he...
If only he were out of the picture...!

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:49.270
Huh? H-Hey! What is this?!
What are you doing?! Are you running away?!

00:16:49.270 --> 00:16:51.770
Even if you had taken down the lord of Albert,

00:16:51.770 --> 00:16:53.480
it would not have affected their army.

00:16:53.480 --> 00:17:00.350
I said I didn't want to hear your opinions!
You just need to follow my orders!

00:17:04.520 --> 00:17:06.980
How?

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:10.310
Why? Where did I go wrong?

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:13.520
At this point...

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:19.810
Status?

00:17:19.810 --> 00:17:21.650
It's all but decided.

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:24.940
Is it true that the Camellian forces came to our aid?

00:17:24.940 --> 00:17:28.650
The thing of it is, they up and vanished at some point.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:30.230
Roy...

00:17:30.230 --> 00:17:33.560
Their main force, Squad 2,
appears to be relocating to the capital.

00:17:33.560 --> 00:17:35.850
We should also regroup with our remaining forces--

00:17:35.850 --> 00:17:36.980
Alfred!

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:45.900
Who are you?!

00:17:45.900 --> 00:17:49.560
My name is Flegel Dreadnought.

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:55.770
Alfred Albert, I challenge you
to settle this with a duel.

00:17:55.770 --> 00:17:58.060
Adelheid, take the princess.

00:17:58.060 --> 00:17:59.060
Right.

00:18:01.020 --> 00:18:04.230
Flegel, this battle is already decided.

00:18:04.230 --> 00:18:05.150
Put your sword away!

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:10.400
Silence! The outcome of the battle
didn't matter to me in the first place!

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:17.350
I'll prove what I'm made of!
I will defeat you, right here and now!

00:18:17.350 --> 00:18:19.850
Wait! There's no point to this!

00:18:19.850 --> 00:18:24.230
Silence! I was born as Balthauser's grandson!

00:18:24.230 --> 00:18:29.480
I have always been compared to you!
You can't know how hard that was!

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:36.520
You, who are well-loved by your people,

00:18:36.520 --> 00:18:40.650
and me, who was even called
a disgrace to the family!

00:18:40.650 --> 00:18:46.270
You were always superior to me!
Always wounding my pride!

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:50.400
Until finally! You started playing hero
in the name of the princess!

00:18:50.400 --> 00:18:53.810
What is so different between you and me?!

00:18:55.060 --> 00:18:59.480
Today is the day when I will outdo you!

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:36.900
If only I had been as privileged as you...

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:40.190
If only I had everything handed to me...

00:19:42.270 --> 00:19:44.690
You, who have everything...

00:19:44.690 --> 00:19:48.730
...cannot understand how I, who have nothing...

00:19:48.730 --> 00:19:52.020
...could possibly feel! Die!

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:06.020
Why? Why...

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:09.310
Why were you the only one...?

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:14.310
You seem to think that Alfred has everything.

00:20:14.310 --> 00:20:15.520
But you are wrong.

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:18.940
Huh? Princess Marielle...

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:24.100
He climbed his way out of
the despair of losing his family,

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:28.100
to carry on his father's place to protect his people,

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:32.770
seeking to grow stronger
and putting in much effort to do so.

00:20:32.770 --> 00:20:35.480
Are you able to do that?

00:20:52.440 --> 00:20:54.600
Flegel...

00:20:54.600 --> 00:20:58.600
This is... This is intolerable.

00:20:58.600 --> 00:21:04.150
Assemble the remaining troops.
We can attack them from behind if we hurry!

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:11.060
What are you waiting for?
Do as you're told, you good-for-nothing!

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:14.650
Why are you pointing a gun at me?

00:21:33.310 --> 00:21:38.020
As I thought, the most he could do
was to buy us some time.

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:40.520
It was the natural outcome.

00:21:40.520 --> 00:21:43.190
Nonetheless, as a result...

00:21:44.770 --> 00:21:46.690
...the time is nearly upon us...

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:02.090
Chapter 10

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:02.090
Showdown

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:02.090
~The March to Liberation~

00:23:33.560 --> 00:23:35.980
No matter what happens, keep the princess safe.

00:23:35.980 --> 00:23:37.810
Go ahead and force it out of me.

00:23:37.810 --> 00:23:39.350
I'm the one who has to do this.

00:23:39.350 --> 00:23:41.310
Promise me that you will come back safely.

00:23:41.310 --> 00:23:46.940
I have a score I have to settle with these monsters!

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
Chapter 11

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
Tug-of-War

00:23:44.060 --> 00:23:47.070
~The Far Reaches of Conviction~
